# Keep the build context lean and keep LOCAL state out of image layers: the
# image needs code + tests only. Weights (models/), outputs (out/) and any local
# .env are bind-mounted or supplied at runtime — `COPY . .` must never bake them
# into layers (issue #29: .venv alone is 28 MB here, GBs in a GPU venv, and a
# local .env can carry a novita key).
.git
.github
.venv
venv
.vendor
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
models
out
*.safetensors
*.gguf
.env
.env.*
docker-compose.override.yml
serve.log
